# Go standard library. Accepted until the image is rebuilt with a patched Go release (SEC-101).
CVE-2025-68121 exp:2026-12-31

# OpenSSL (libcrypto3, libssl3). Not reachable from the app; accepted until the base image is updated (SEC-102).
